      "content": "i mean, you're basically just listing the arguments, but don't you think the biological reality of physical advantage is just an objective fact? It feels like the \"inclusivity\" argument is being used to ignore science just to avoid controversy. shouldn't the facts of physiology take precedence over social feelings when it comes to actual competition?",
